  "notes": "Two driver sessions prove the trade double-lock contract. Both sides commit funded offers, dual acceptance opens confirmation, and an offer mutation clears both locks. After relocking, the first confirmation leaves assets untouched and the second atomically swaps both item sides and currency. Both participants receive the executed event, and a duplicate terminal confirmation rejects with no_trade_session."
